"name": "width"}, "name": "width", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "宽度"}, {"widget": {"name": "height"}, "name": "height", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "高度"}, {"widget": {"name": "batch_size"}, "name": "batch_size", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "批次大小"}], "flags": {}, "type": "EmptyLatentImage", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [324, 139.59375], "pos": [-2240.761474609375, 154.4273223876953], "id": 7, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.3.75", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "EmptyLatentImage"}, "order": 5}, {"outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "字符串"}], "color": "#4644e9", "widgets_values": ["生成 1:1 正方形图，所有模块服饰头饰一致。  \n上半区 EXACTLY 3 个全身图横排：  \n左：骨盆向右转 45°，躯干向右扭 45°，左肩在前，右肩在后（肚脐朝右前，严禁躯干正面）。  \n中：骨盆向左转 45°，躯干向左扭 45°，右肩在前，左肩在后（肚脐朝左前，严禁躯干正面）。  \n右：背面。  \n下半区 EXACTLY 4 个面部特写横排：  \n1.闭嘴无表情（双眼睁开）  \n2.闭嘴微笑（闭嘴不露齿，颈椎倾斜 15-30 度带动整个头部倾斜，严禁只转头或颈部直立）  \n3.露齿笑  \n4.惊讶 O 型  \n所有全身图双脚完整可见，所有表情含完整发冠，背景纯净无文字。  \n自检：3 个全身图躯干都扭转 45°（看肚脐方向），表情 2 整个头部倾斜，表情 1 睁眼，服饰头饰一致。\n\n**风格：** 妖娆清丽的玄幻古风插画，暖色调，光影强烈。\n**服饰：** 暖色调淡橙与淡粉色系的苏绣华服，质地轻盈的披肩纱衣与披帛，细节处可见繁复的刺绣纹样，尽显婀娜多姿的身材。\n**头饰：** 黑色繁复蓬松的“珠帘花月髻”，巧夺天工。配有精致的蝶形步摇、鬓边帘、垂帘饰以及各种点缀宝石的簪子。佩戴一顶簪花白色纱帘流苏帷帽（半掩，露出精致面容）。\n**发型：** 真实发丝质感，乌黑浓密的复古发髻，发丝在阳光下有细腻的光泽。\n**妆容：** 冷白皮，瓷肌质感，面部在阳光下微微发亮。精致五官，魅惑而空灵，带有细腻的肌理与光影斑驳的效果。\n\n{\n  \"action\": \"generate_image\",\n  \"prompt\": \"A 1:1 square character design sheet of a slender, fair-skinned ancient Chinese fantasy beauty. Upper half: 3 full-body views in a row. Left: pelvis and torso turned 45 degrees right, left shoulder forward, navel facing front-right. Middle: pelvis and torso turned 45 degrees left, right shoulder forward, navel facing front-left. Right: full back view. All full-body shots show feet. Lower half: 4 facial close-ups in a row. 1: Neutral expression, mouth closed, eyes open. 2: Smiling with mouth closed, entire head tilted 20 degrees. 3: Smiling with teeth showing. 4: Surprised 'O' shaped mouth. Character details: Complex black 'Pearl Moon' bun with butterfly hairpins, tassels, and gemstone chains. Wearing a white gauze veil hat (side-pinned). Outfit is light orange and pink Suzhou embroidery robes with a flowing shawl. Warm lighting, strong chiaroscuro, dappled light and shadow, ultra-high definition, realistic skin texture, 8k resolution, no text in background.\"\n}", [false, true]], "inputs": [{"name": "text", "link": 49, "label": "文本", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "type": "PreviewTextNode", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#3230d5", "size": [462.6764221191406, 818.1344604492188], "pos": [-1753.853759765625, -26.251895904541016], "id": 33, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui_custom_nodes_alekpet", "ver": "fcf4c2e68e2a035465cb3273cb858a0f31d3bfd8", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PreviewTextNode"}, "order": 9}, {"outputs": [{"name": "text", "links": [47], "label": "文本", "type": "*", "localized_name": "text"}, {"name": "show_help", "label": "显示帮助", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "show_help"}], "color": "#232", "widgets_values": ["半身构图，镜头近距离，近距离写真，逼真，冷白皮，身材苗条纤细，黑色繁复蓬松珠帘花月髻，真实发丝，阳光下脸蛋微微发亮，妖娆清丽，婀娜多姿，苏绣，披肩纱衣披帛，发饰巧夺天工，白色纱帘流苏帷帽，簪花帷帽，半掩帷帽，各种精致蝶形步摇，鬓边帘，垂帘饰，簪花，各种精致点缀簪子，细小宝石链，玄幻古风插画，暖色调淡橙淡粉服装配色，冷白皮。明暗对比，光影强烈，光影斑驳，浮光，出片姿势，超高清，魅力，最高画质，细腻渲染，冷白皮，细节五官。丰富细节，魅惑，清透肌肤，瓷肌，高清32k，面部阴影，面部聚焦，空灵感，高质量，写实逼真，有质感，细腻肌理"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {}, "type": "CR Text", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [536.3993530273438, 280.49615478515625], "pos": [-2309.655517578125, -436.4319763183594], "id": 21, "properties": {"cnr_id": "ComfyUI_Comfyroll_CustomNodes", "ver": "d78b780ae43fcf8c6b7c6505e6ffb4584281ceca", "widget_ue_connectable": {"text": true}, "Node name for S&R": "CR Text"}, "order": 6}], "extra": {"VHS_KeepIntermediate": true, "links_added_by_ue": [], "VHS_MetadataImage": true, "ue_links": [], "0246.VERSION": [0, 0, 4], "workflowRendererVersion": "Vue", "VHS_latentpreviewrate": 0, "fr